Learning outcomes:
- Perform text analysis and use NLP to extract insights from text data. 
- Process unstructured and semi-structured data sources and reformat into more machine-readable formats. 
- Scrape information from external websites and process into a structured format 
- Use Python (or a programming language of your choice) for data manipulation, analysis, visualisation, and system integration. 
- Develop reproducible analysis and robust code. 
